      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791798234245,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "M = inside matrix, gets a spot in C\n\nR = too far right: col >= WIDTH\ncaught by index_2d (gives None)\n\nD = too far down: row >= WIDTH\ncaught by our own check (row < WIDTH)\n\nX = BOTH",
      "fontSize": 17.040449460830416,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "M = inside matrix, gets a spot in C\n\nR = too far right: col >= WIDTH\ncaught by index_2d (gives None)\n\nD = too far down: row >= WIDTH\ncaught by our own check (row < WIDTH)\n\nX = BOTH",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
